WEBVTT

00:00.470 --> 00:01.390
<b>Listen up.</b>

00:01.390 --> 00:02.850
<b>I'm only lending it to you.</b>

00:03.230 --> 00:04.190
<b>You have to return it.</b>

00:06.770 --> 00:08.070
<b>All right.</b>

00:08.070 --> 00:09.980
<b>I will make sure
to return it to you,</b>

00:09.980 --> 00:12.530
<b>so rest assured and wait for me
at the dojo, that you will.</b>

00:15.910 --> 00:16.740
<b>Okay.</b>

00:22.790 --> 00:23.660
<b>Kenshin!</b>

00:27.750 --> 00:31.130
<b>VINDICATION NOTE OF ASSASSINATION
TONIGHT AT MIDNIGHT, I WILL
WAIT IN FRONT OF THE INARI
AT THE TOWN SHRINE GROVE
JINE</b>

02:15.990 --> 02:19.990
<b>EPISODE 7: THE TWO HITOKIRI</b>

02:28.250 --> 02:30.250
<b>Don't glare so much.</b>

02:30.250 --> 02:34.340
<b>It's not like I abducted you
with plans to eat you or anything.</b>

02:34.590 --> 02:35.880
<b>I know that.</b>

02:36.300 --> 02:38.720
<b>You did this to whittle off
some of Kenshin's power.</b>

02:38.720 --> 02:40.840
<b>Kurogasa turned out
to be quite the chicken.</b>

02:41.340 --> 02:43.220
<b>You really don't get it.</b>

02:44.560 --> 02:47.770
<b>If I take you hostage,
Battosai will be angered.</b>

02:48.270 --> 02:52.310
<b>Anger will return him
to the hitokiri that he once was.</b>

02:53.270 --> 02:55.610
<b>The current Battosai has lost his touch.</b>

02:56.230 --> 02:59.400
<b>I can defeat him
before I finish smoking one cigarette.</b>

02:59.990 --> 03:01.780
<b>And that would be too boring.</b>

03:03.490 --> 03:05.910
<b>Not only are you a coward,
but a liar, too?</b>

03:05.910 --> 03:09.040
<b>You can't possibly be unaware
of Kenshin's strength, right?</b>

03:10.290 --> 03:12.330
<b>You're the one that doesn't know...</b>

03:13.000 --> 03:15.210
<b>the skills of Hitokiri Battosai</b>

03:15.210 --> 03:19.550
<b>that gives you goosebumps
just by hearing about them.</b>

03:23.970 --> 03:29.140
<b>The first time I saw him was in Kyoto
back during the Bakumatsu Era.</b>

03:30.020 --> 03:32.560
<b>I had heard rumors about the Hitokiri.</b>

03:32.560 --> 03:36.070
<b>But we were the Shinsengumi.</b>

03:36.070 --> 03:38.280
<b>There was no way
we'd lose against one man.</b>

03:38.780 --> 03:40.360
<b>That's what I had thought.</b>

03:55.540 --> 03:57.210
<b>It took just one moment.</b>

03:57.800 --> 04:00.380
<b>In the moment
that moonlight filled the alleyway,</b>

04:00.380 --> 04:03.930
<b>he killed the three other men.</b>

04:05.970 --> 04:06.970
<b>Hey.</b>

04:07.720 --> 04:09.220
<b>Tell your comrades.</b>

04:09.930 --> 04:12.430
<b>If you're going to slay
any more Revolutionary warriors...</b>

04:12.980 --> 04:16.190
<b>you will have to fight me.</b>

04:31.950 --> 04:34.460
<b>If I had fought him right then,</b>

04:34.960 --> 04:38.540
<b>I would have quickly sunk into the shadows
right then and there.</b>

04:39.000 --> 04:40.460
<b>But it's different now.</b>

04:40.960 --> 04:44.630
<b>I have killed so many, friend and foe.</b>

04:46.840 --> 04:51.100
<b>I was able to become a hitokiri,
just like him.</b>

04:51.720 --> 04:56.060
<b>Two hitokiri killing each other
in a dire situation.</b>

04:56.850 --> 04:59.110
<b>That is what is most amusing.</b>

04:59.320 --> 05:00.150
<b>Kenshin is—</b>

05:00.360 --> 05:04.360
<b>I can tell
exactly what kind of man I'm looking at</b>

05:04.360 --> 05:09.370
<b>and what kind of man you're looking at.</b>

05:19.590 --> 05:20.920
<b>Now...</b>

05:23.010 --> 05:24.340
<b>it's midnight.</b>

05:25.090 --> 05:27.550
<b>The beginning of a very fun moment.</b>

05:28.470 --> 05:31.430
<b>Right, Battosai?</b>

05:31.640 --> 05:32.470
<b>Kenshin!</b>

05:39.860 --> 05:41.520
<b>I like that glare.</b>

05:41.520 --> 05:43.030
<b>You are indeed angry.</b>

05:43.650 --> 05:44.490
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:44.820 --> 05:47.360
<b>Against you
for roping Miss Kaoru into this</b>

05:47.860 --> 05:51.080
<b>and against myself
for not being able to stop it.</b>

05:51.910 --> 05:52.910
<b><i>"Myself."</i></b>

05:53.580 --> 05:55.660
<b>Wonderful. Splendid.</b>

05:55.660 --> 05:58.870
<b>Your speech pattern has reverted
to that of the Bakumatsu Era.</b>

05:59.670 --> 06:00.670
<b>And now...</b>

06:00.840 --> 06:03.250
<b>if you flip the blade
of that sword around,</b>

06:03.250 --> 06:06.260
<b>the legendary Hitokiri makes his return.</b>

06:06.670 --> 06:07.630
<b>Kenshin.</b>

06:33.780 --> 06:34.740
<b>So cheeky!</b>

06:34.950 --> 06:35.870
<b><i>He's different.</i></b>

06:36.370 --> 06:38.250
<b><i>This isn't the usual Kenshin after all.</i></b>

06:38.960 --> 06:41.750
<b>I told you that Shin No Ippo won't work!</b>

06:43.170 --> 06:45.500
<b><i>Nikaido Heiho starts with...</i></b>

06:45.710 --> 06:46.760
<b><i>Katate Hirazuki!</i></b>

06:48.010 --> 06:48.920
<b><i>Next...</i></b>

06:49.800 --> 06:52.010
<b><i>Letter One stance, Yokonagi.</i></b>

06:52.970 --> 06:55.260
<b><i>Letter Ten stance, Karatake-wari.</i></b>

06:56.140 --> 06:57.390
<b><i>And here...</i></b>

06:57.390 --> 06:58.310
<b><i>I disrupt!</i></b>

07:13.490 --> 07:16.450
<b>You seem to have been
reading my movements,</b>

07:16.450 --> 07:19.000
<b>but you couldn't predict Haishato.</b>

07:20.160 --> 07:21.250
<b>You're not quite there.</b>

07:21.750 --> 07:25.670
<b>I can kill your current self
in the time I smoke three cigarettes.</b>

07:25.880 --> 07:26.800
<b>Kenshin!</b>

07:28.760 --> 07:30.300
<b>This is boring.</b>

07:30.930 --> 07:33.140
<b>I need you to feel more anger.</b>

07:44.610 --> 07:45.560
<b>Miss Kaoru!</b>

07:45.900 --> 07:49.400
<b>I cast a slightly stronger
Shin No Ippo on her,</b>

07:49.400 --> 07:51.990
<b>to the point
where lung function is paralyzed.</b>

07:52.320 --> 07:54.320
<b>She will last no longer than two minutes.</b>

07:55.280 --> 07:58.160
<b>This can't be undone
as easily as last night.</b>

07:58.370 --> 08:00.580
<b>Suffocation is an ugly death.</b>

08:01.080 --> 08:04.710
<b>Drool, urine, and feces
will ooze out of the corpse.</b>

08:05.210 --> 08:06.710
<b>Jine.</b>

08:07.630 --> 08:09.880
<b>You don't have time to chat.</b>

08:10.550 --> 08:13.180
<b>Everything you want to say,
do so with that sword.</b>

08:19.720 --> 08:21.810
<b>Oh ho, that just now...</b>

08:21.810 --> 08:23.390
<b>not only did I miss the sword gleam,</b>

08:23.390 --> 08:25.770
<b>I didn't even see
how you carried yourself.</b>

08:25.770 --> 08:28.110
<b>So this is Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu.</b>

08:28.400 --> 08:30.730
<b>This is the Hitokiri Battosai!</b>

08:33.950 --> 08:36.160
<b>No time to chat.</b>

08:37.240 --> 08:40.120
<b>I will kill you,
so hurry up, and get on with it.</b>

08:44.500 --> 08:45.670
<b><i>Kenshin.</i></b>

08:46.170 --> 08:48.170
<b>"I will kill you," eh?</b>

08:49.380 --> 08:50.670
<b>Wonderful.</b>

08:53.170 --> 08:56.140
<b>A line fit for a hitokiri.</b>

08:57.010 --> 08:57.970
<b><i>Kenshin!</i></b>

09:00.470 --> 09:04.060
<b>Now that you have returned to the
Hitokiri Battosai of the Bakumatsu Era,</b>

09:04.060 --> 09:06.730
<b>this is where our true showdown begins!</b>

09:06.730 --> 09:08.400
<b>Here goes, Battosai!</b>

09:12.400 --> 09:13.530
<b>What's wrong?</b>

09:14.950 --> 09:18.120
<b>When you have a murderous intent,
it really is different.</b>

09:18.820 --> 09:20.990
<b>If you're fearing for your life,</b>

09:20.990 --> 09:23.410
<b>release the Shin No Ippo
that you put on Miss Kaoru.</b>

09:23.910 --> 09:26.000
<b>I can't release it anymore.</b>

09:26.000 --> 09:27.540
<b>She has to do so on her own,</b>

09:27.540 --> 09:30.380
<b>or the caster must be killed
to sever the sword aura.</b>

09:31.130 --> 09:33.460
<b>You only have two choices.</b>

09:33.760 --> 09:37.680
<b>Of course,
the former is likely impossible.</b>

09:37.930 --> 09:40.140
<b>Then I will just have to kill you.</b>

09:40.640 --> 09:42.390
<b>That's also impossible.</b>

09:42.770 --> 09:47.350
<b>Humans are creatures that are
surprisingly weak against assumptions.</b>

09:48.310 --> 09:51.230
<b>Shin No Ippo
takes advantage of that weakness</b>

09:51.230 --> 09:55.400
<b>and uses the heightened sword aura
to cower and paralyze the enemy.</b>

09:55.900 --> 09:59.910
<b>Assumptions do indeed
influence the human body.</b>

10:00.200 --> 10:03.740
<b>And I, as the caster, am no exemption!</b>

10:10.630 --> 10:13.300
<b>I... am... undefeated!</b>

10:14.000 --> 10:15.460
<b><i>I see.</i></b>

10:15.460 --> 10:21.300
<b><i>He's putting a strong hypnosis on himself
to unleash all of his potential.</i></b>

10:21.890 --> 10:24.720
<b>I... am... invincible!</b>

10:30.480 --> 10:33.570
<b>I... am... the strongest!</b>

10:35.030 --> 10:38.950
<b>Shin No Ippo:
Shadow Skill, Hyoki Spell!</b>

10:39.610 --> 10:44.080
<b>This is the first time I'm using this
since I have left the Shinsengumi,</b>

10:44.080 --> 10:46.080
<b>the first time in 15 years.</b>

10:54.920 --> 10:57.420
<b>If you call it an unfair skill,
it indeed would be.</b>

10:58.670 --> 11:00.550
<b>But I will go ahead and use it.</b>

11:01.050 --> 11:01.930
<b>I don't care.</b>

11:02.430 --> 11:04.720
<b>You can use whatever skills you want.</b>

11:06.060 --> 11:06.890
<b>However...</b>

11:13.610 --> 11:15.860
<b>now that I have said I will kill you...</b>

11:17.360 --> 11:19.530
<b>your death is absolute.</b>

11:26.040 --> 11:29.040
<b>RUROUNI KENSHIN</b>

11:34.630 --> 11:37.710
<b><i>This is the stance
for a battoujutsu attack.</i></b>

11:38.590 --> 11:40.380
<b><i>Battoujutsu...</i></b>

11:40.380 --> 11:44.680
<b><i>a technique where the blade of a sword
races within the sheath</i></b>

11:44.680 --> 11:48.520
<b><i>and the sword speed doubles,
even triples, when it is drawn out.</i></b>

11:48.810 --> 11:51.810
<b><i>A grand sure-kill attack
that slays the opponent</i></b>

11:51.810 --> 11:54.480
<b><i>without providing
an opportunity to counterattack.</i></b>

11:55.480 --> 12:00.990
<b>Come. I will let you have a good taste
of the street name "Battosai."</b>

12:01.450 --> 12:06.080
<b><i>Battosai, user of the divine-speed
sword style Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu.</i></b>

12:06.700 --> 12:08.620
<b><i>Indeed the fastest ever!</i></b>

12:09.410 --> 12:11.960
<b><i>But if I can dodge that, I can win!</i></b>

12:12.540 --> 12:14.170
<b><i>Battoujutsu are sure-kill attacks,</i></b>

12:14.170 --> 12:16.500
<b><i>which means a misfire
leads to his own death.</i></b>

12:16.500 --> 12:18.750
<b><i>A dangerous double-edged attack.</i></b>

12:20.590 --> 12:21.720
<b><i>Can I dodge it?</i></b>

12:25.340 --> 12:27.680
<b><i>I can! I can dodge this!</i></b>

12:29.010 --> 12:32.520
<b>Showdown time, Himura Battosai!</b>

12:35.940 --> 12:40.150
<b><i>Battosai, you aren't aware
of your fatal flaw!</i></b>

12:40.320 --> 12:41.650
<b><i>And that's your sword.</i></b>

12:42.150 --> 12:44.320
<b><i>A sakabato is disadvantageous
for battoujutsu!</i></b>

12:44.820 --> 12:47.490
<b><i>As the back
is on the convex side of the arc,</i></b>

12:47.490 --> 12:49.990
<b><i>you can't get the blade
to race enough within the sheath,</i></b>

12:49.990 --> 12:52.500
<b><i>slightly slowing down
the sword-draw speed.</i></b>

12:52.660 --> 12:56.000
<b><i>And that difference is
my perfect opportunity for victory!</i></b>

12:59.670 --> 13:00.670
<b><i>So fast!</i></b>

13:00.670 --> 13:02.800
<b><i>But if I can dodge this...</i></b>

13:05.260 --> 13:06.510
<b><i>I dodged it!</i></b>

13:06.510 --> 13:07.930
<b><i>Victory is mine!</i></b>

13:08.140 --> 13:09.720
<b>Battosai!</b>

13:13.980 --> 13:16.400
<b><i>Wha— This is—</i></b>

13:17.350 --> 13:21.440
<b><i>A double battoujutsu
using both sword and sheath!</i></b>

13:24.070 --> 13:27.660
<b>Hiten Mitsurugi-ryu Battoujutsu:
Soryuusen.</b>

13:28.450 --> 13:31.620
<b>I am fully aware that battoujutsu
are double-edged attacks</b>

13:31.620 --> 13:34.290
<b>and that a sakabato
is unfit for battoujutsu.</b>

13:34.290 --> 13:38.880
<b>The man who mastered
the most powerful battoujutsu...</b>

13:39.380 --> 13:42.210
<b>that is the origin
of my street name, Battosai.</b>

13:43.090 --> 13:45.720
<b>I shattered your elbow joint
and severed your tendon.</b>

13:46.590 --> 13:49.050
<b>Your life as a swordsman is over.</b>

13:49.300 --> 13:50.640
<b>And this...</b>

13:51.810 --> 13:53.640
<b>is the end of your life.</b>

13:59.150 --> 14:00.020
<b>Die.</b>

14:00.860 --> 14:01.820
<b>Kenshin!</b>

14:11.620 --> 14:13.240
<b>What's wrong, Battosai?</b>

14:13.740 --> 14:15.620
<b>What are you hesitating for?</b>

14:16.080 --> 14:19.710
<b>To release the Shin No Ippo,
you have to kill me.</b>

14:20.710 --> 14:22.880
<b>This is too easy a choice.</b>

14:23.710 --> 14:26.130
<b>The evil blade of the legendary Hitokiri.</b>

14:26.720 --> 14:30.340
<b>Give me a blow right here
to take to the afterlife.</b>

14:31.050 --> 14:35.470
<b>Right. I don't want to give you
anything to take with you.</b>

14:35.930 --> 14:41.940
<b>But in order to protect Miss Kaoru,
I must once again revert to a hitokiri.</b>

14:43.400 --> 14:44.940
<b>That's how it should be!</b>

14:44.940 --> 14:48.530
<b>Let me, Jine, taste your evil blade!</b>

14:48.650 --> 14:49.490
<b>Die.</b>

14:53.450 --> 14:55.200
<b><i>Swords are weapons.</i></b>

14:55.200 --> 14:57.000
<b><i>Swordsmanship is a means of murder.</i></b>

14:57.500 --> 15:01.960
<b><i>No matter how you sugarcoat it
or have lofty ideals, that is the truth.</i></b>

15:02.710 --> 15:05.960
<b><i>But in the face of such awful truth...</i></b>

15:07.050 --> 15:11.590
<b><i>I much prefer
Miss Kaoru's naïve lies, that I do.</i></b>

15:12.600 --> 15:16.060
<b>Ken... shin.</b>

15:18.060 --> 15:19.020
<b>Kenshin!</b>

15:20.520 --> 15:23.110
<b>You can't!</b>

15:26.900 --> 15:29.650
<b>Don't return to being a hitokiri.</b>

15:30.200 --> 15:33.620
<b>You can't use... a murderous sword.</b>

15:33.950 --> 15:34.870
<b>Miss Kaoru!</b>

15:35.620 --> 15:38.580
<b>Miss Kaoru, get a hold of yourself!
Are you all right, that you are?</b>

15:40.080 --> 15:40.920
<b>Miss Kaoru!</b>

15:42.170 --> 15:45.000
<b>I am all right, Kenshin, that I am.</b>

15:45.000 --> 15:45.840
<b>Oro?</b>

15:47.050 --> 15:50.800
<b>Your speech pattern is back to normal.</b>

15:51.130 --> 15:52.260
<b>Oh.</b>

15:52.260 --> 15:53.760
<b>I'm fine.</b>

15:54.390 --> 15:55.600
<b>I'm all right,</b>

15:55.600 --> 15:56.430
<b>so please—</b>

15:58.640 --> 16:02.060
<b>I can understand
that bird head from last night,</b>

16:02.060 --> 16:06.400
<b>but this little girl
broke my Shin No Ippo, too?</b>

16:07.020 --> 16:10.070
<b>It seems I myself have lost my touch.</b>

16:11.030 --> 16:12.280
<b>Stop it, Jine.</b>

16:12.820 --> 16:16.870
<b>You only have one wakizashi,
and you can only use your left arm.</b>

16:16.870 --> 16:20.410
<b>You have no chance of winning,
that you don't. It's all over now.</b>

16:21.040 --> 16:23.460
<b>You should calmly wait for your arrest,
that you should.</b>

16:24.170 --> 16:26.420
<b>No, it's not over yet.</b>

16:27.130 --> 16:30.050
<b>I still have to deal with the aftermath.</b>

16:37.100 --> 16:39.970
<b>This sensation... so good.</b>

16:46.610 --> 16:50.320
<b>Y-You look like you don't get it.</b>

16:51.320 --> 16:52.740
<b>I told you.</b>

16:53.650 --> 16:55.360
<b>This is the aftermath.</b>

16:56.370 --> 17:01.700
<b>I-If I get caught
and the investigation goes on...</b>

17:02.200 --> 17:06.130
<b>they're sure to track back
to the Imperialist government official</b>

17:06.130 --> 17:08.590
<b>that requested a Hitokiri.</b>

17:08.590 --> 17:09.420
<b>What?</b>

17:11.050 --> 17:13.170
<b>You couldn't have possibly believed</b>

17:13.170 --> 17:17.510
<b>that hitokiri were no longer needed
in the Meiji Era.</b>

17:17.970 --> 17:20.760
<b>That's why I said you lost your touch.</b>

17:22.310 --> 17:23.560
<b>They're all worked up</b>

17:23.560 --> 17:27.060
<b>about the Revolution, Meiji Era,
and new government.</b>

17:27.060 --> 17:28.440
<b>But on the inside,</b>

17:28.440 --> 17:32.320
<b>a power struggle similar
to the Bakumatsu Era still continues.</b>

17:33.030 --> 17:37.280
<b>They want to get rid
of those that stand in the way,</b>

17:37.280 --> 17:40.990
<b>but with modernization of the system
and the police force developing,</b>

17:40.990 --> 17:44.910
<b>they can't simply slay men like before.</b>

17:45.460 --> 17:50.290
<b>On the other hand, I can't
easily escape the bloody path I entered,</b>

17:50.290 --> 17:51.800
<b>nor do I want to leave it.</b>

17:52.300 --> 17:56.470
<b>So the politician and the hitokiri
had common interests,</b>

17:56.470 --> 18:00.600
<b>and the evil-bladed hooligan Kurogasa
was born.</b>

18:01.680 --> 18:04.520
<b>A hitokiri slays men on his own will.</b>

18:05.020 --> 18:08.520
<b>However, he doesn't choose his own target.</b>

18:09.100 --> 18:12.780
<b>I ignored that and challenged you,</b>

18:12.780 --> 18:16.150
<b>and that's why I have met
such a pathetic death.</b>

18:16.150 --> 18:17.450
<b>But, oh, well.</b>

18:18.320 --> 18:22.830
<b>Now that my right arm is busted,
staying alive only brings boredom.</b>

18:23.740 --> 18:24.790
<b>Jine...</b>

18:25.080 --> 18:28.540
<b>Stop looking at me like that, Battosai.</b>

18:28.540 --> 18:33.920
<b>Your eyes looked so much better
when you said you would kill me.</b>

18:35.210 --> 18:38.510
<b>Your true nature
is still that of a hitokiri.</b>

18:38.510 --> 18:41.300
<b>A fellow hitokiri is telling you,
so you can be sure of it.</b>

18:42.050 --> 18:45.600
<b>A hitokiri is only that until he dies.</b>

18:46.100 --> 18:49.310
<b>He can't become anything else.</b>

18:49.690 --> 18:51.980
<b>I'll be watching from the edges of hell</b>

18:51.980 --> 18:56.780
<b>on how long you can still
spout off about being a rurouni.</b>

19:08.540 --> 19:12.500
<b><i>"A hitokiri is only that until he dies."</i></b>

19:17.340 --> 19:18.510
<b><i>"Until he dies."</i></b>

19:20.930 --> 19:22.010
<b>Kenshin.</b>

19:23.760 --> 19:25.850
<b>Let's go home, Miss Kaoru, that we should.</b>

