<b>Kenshin.</b>

19:43.740 --> 19:45.950
<b>Oh. What is it, that is?</b>

19:46.740 --> 19:51.250
<b>Thank you for saving me.
I'll give you my thanks for now.</b>

19:52.750 --> 19:56.840
<b>No, I am the one
that should be thanking you, that I am.</b>

19:57.420 --> 19:58.550
<b>I give you my gratitude.</b>

