<b>Oro?</b>

20:20.650 --> 20:22.450
<b>What's with this? It's covered in blood!</b>

20:22.910 --> 20:26.490
<b>I see. The blood from the wound
on my left shoulder</b>

20:26.490 --> 20:28.660
<b>trickled down to the breast pocket,
